WEBVTT

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:48.601
Let's go.

00:00:48.601 --> 00:00:51.648
Harry Potter
has caught the Snitch!

00:00:51.648 --> 00:00:53.911
Gryffindor wins!

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:02.224
Finite Incantato!

00:01:09.274 --> 00:01:10.275
Thank you.

00:01:10.275 --> 00:01:11.668
Are you okay?

00:01:11.668 --> 00:01:13.278
No. I think...
I think my arm's broken.

00:01:13.278 --> 00:01:14.801
Not to worry, Harry.

00:01:14.801 --> 00:01:16.281
I will fix that arm
of yours straight away.

00:01:16.281 --> 00:01:17.848
Not you.

00:01:17.848 --> 00:01:19.676
Poor boy, doesn't know
what he's saying.

00:01:19.676 --> 00:01:20.764
Now, this...

00:01:20.764 --> 00:01:23.767
won't hurt a bit.

00:01:29.773 --> 00:01:32.863
Brackium Emendo!

00:01:40.827 --> 00:01:42.438
Yes, well...

00:01:42.438 --> 00:01:46.529
that can sometimes happen,
but the point is...

00:01:46.529 --> 00:01:49.401
you can no longer
feel any pain,

00:01:49.401 --> 00:01:52.012
and very clearly,
the bones are not broken.

00:01:52.012 --> 00:01:54.798
Broken? There's no bones left!

00:01:56.626 --> 00:01:58.454
Much more flexible,
though.

00:01:58.454 --> 00:02:01.413
[MALFOY MOANING]

00:02:01.413 --> 00:02:03.763
On, Mr. Malfoy, stop making
such a fuss. You can go.

00:02:03.763 --> 00:02:05.417
Out of my way.
Out of my way!

00:02:05.417 --> 00:02:07.419
Should have been brought
straight to me.

00:02:07.419 --> 00:02:09.726
I can mend bones in a heartbeat,
but growing them back?

00:02:09.726 --> 00:02:11.467
You will be able to, won't you?

00:02:11.467 --> 00:02:14.731
Oh, I'll be able to, certainly,
but it will be painful.

00:02:14.731 --> 00:02:17.255
You're in for a rough night,
Potter.

00:02:17.255 --> 00:02:19.866
Regrowing bones
is a nasty business.

00:02:22.739 --> 00:02:26.525
Well, what do you expect,
pumpkin juice?

00:02:32.401 --> 00:02:34.707
Kill.

00:02:34.707 --> 00:02:36.840
Kill.

00:02:40.844 --> 00:02:43.542
Time to kill.

00:02:51.246 --> 00:02:52.377
Hello.

00:02:54.074 --> 00:02:55.511
Dobby?

00:02:55.511 --> 00:02:57.730
Harry Potter should have
listened to Dobby.

00:02:57.730 --> 00:02:59.689
Harry Potter should
have gone back home

00:02:59.689 --> 00:03:02.474
when he missed the train.

00:03:02.474 --> 00:03:04.346
It was you.

00:03:04.346 --> 00:03:06.565
You stopped the barrier
from letting Ron and me through.

00:03:06.565 --> 00:03:09.133
Indeed. Yes, sir.

00:03:10.743 --> 00:03:13.355
You nearly got
Ron and me expelled.

00:03:13.355 --> 00:03:16.793
At least you would be
away from here.

00:03:16.793 --> 00:03:19.274
Harry Potter
must go home.

00:03:19.274 --> 00:03:21.841
Dobby thought his Bludger
would be enough

00:03:21.841 --> 00:03:23.016
to make Harry Potter
see that--

00:03:23.016 --> 00:03:24.366
Your Bludger?

00:03:24.366 --> 00:03:26.324
You made that Bludger
chase after me?

00:03:26.324 --> 00:03:30.372
Dobby feels most aggrieved, sir.

00:03:30.372 --> 00:03:33.940
Dobby had to iron his hands.

00:03:36.116 --> 00:03:38.510
You'd better clear off before
my bones come back, Dobby,

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:40.164
or I might strangle you.

00:03:42.993 --> 00:03:44.995
Dobby is used
to death threats, sir.

00:03:44.995 --> 00:03:48.259
Dobby gets them
five times a day at home.

00:03:48.259 --> 00:03:49.695
I don't suppose
you could tell me

00:03:49.695 --> 00:03:51.393
why you're trying
to kill me?

00:03:51.393 --> 00:03:56.049
Not kill you, sir.
Never kill you.

00:03:56.049 --> 00:03:57.921
Dobby remembers how it was

00:03:57.921 --> 00:04:02.360
before Harry Potter triumphed
over He-Who-Must-Not-Be-Named.

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:06.234
We house-elfs were
treated like vermin, sir.

00:04:06.234 --> 00:04:11.413
Of course, Dobby is still
treated like vermin.

00:04:11.413 --> 00:04:15.155
[SOBBING]

00:04:21.336 --> 00:04:23.076
Why do you wear that thing,
Dobby?

00:04:23.076 --> 00:04:25.644
This, sir?

00:04:25.644 --> 00:04:29.387
It is a mark
of the house-elf's enslavement.

00:04:29.387 --> 00:04:30.997
Dobby could only be freed

00:04:30.997 --> 00:04:34.305
if his master presents him
with clothes.

00:04:34.305 --> 00:04:36.873
[BANGING]

00:04:36.873 --> 00:04:40.006
Listen...listen!

00:04:40.006 --> 00:04:43.445
Terrible things are about
to happen at Hogwarts.

00:04:43.445 --> 00:04:46.970
Harry Potter
must not stay here

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:50.408
now that history
is to repeat itself.

00:04:50.408 --> 00:04:51.931
Repeat itself?

00:04:51.931 --> 00:04:54.978
You mean
this has happened before?

00:04:54.978 --> 00:04:57.241
I shouldn't have said that.

00:05:00.723 --> 00:05:02.246
Bad Dobby!

00:05:02.246 --> 00:05:03.900
Dobby, Stop it. Stop it.

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:07.382
Stop it, Dobby!

00:05:07.382 --> 00:05:10.210
Tell me, Dobby.
When did this happen before?

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:11.647
Who's doing it now?

00:05:11.647 --> 00:05:13.779
Dobby cannot say, sir.

00:05:13.779 --> 00:05:16.521
Dobby only wants
Harry Potter to be safe.

00:05:16.521 --> 00:05:18.610
No, Dobby. Tell me.
Who is it?

00:05:18.610 --> 00:05:19.872
[DOOR OPENING]

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:32.537
Put him here.

00:05:37.020 --> 00:05:38.369
What happened?

00:05:38.369 --> 00:05:39.892
There's been
another attack.

00:05:39.892 --> 00:05:41.546
I think...

00:05:41.546 --> 00:05:43.896
Do you know,
I think he's been Petrified,

00:05:43.896 --> 00:05:46.943
Madame Pomfrey.

00:05:46.943 --> 00:05:50.425
Perhaps he managed to take
a picture of his attacker.

00:05:59.564 --> 00:06:02.437
What can this mean, Albus?

00:06:02.437 --> 00:06:07.267
It means that our students
are in great danger.

00:06:07.267 --> 00:06:09.966
What should I tell the staff?

00:06:09.966 --> 00:06:11.402
The truth.

00:06:11.402 --> 00:06:15.363
Tell them
Hogwarts is no longer safe.

00:06:15.363 --> 00:06:18.714
It is as we feared,
Minerva.

00:06:18.714 --> 00:06:23.240
The Chamber of Secrets
has indeed been opened again.

00:06:26.112 --> 00:06:27.766
HERMIONE: Again?

00:06:27.766 --> 00:06:30.247
You mean, the Chamber of Secrets
has been opened before?

00:06:30.247 --> 00:06:33.163
Of course.
Don't you see?

00:06:33.163 --> 00:06:34.643
Lucius Malfoy must have
opened it

00:06:34.643 --> 00:06:36.514
when he was at school here,

00:06:36.514 --> 00:06:38.995
and now he's taught Draco
how to do it.

00:06:38.995 --> 00:06:41.476
Maybe. We'll have to wait
for the Polyjuice Potion

00:06:41.476 --> 00:06:42.955
to know for sure.

00:06:42.955 --> 00:06:44.479
Enlighten me.

00:06:44.479 --> 00:06:47.482
Why are we brewing this potion
in broad daylight...

00:06:47.482 --> 00:06:49.135
in the middle
of a girls' lavatory?

00:06:49.135 --> 00:06:51.268
Don't you think
we'll get caught?

00:06:51.268 --> 00:06:54.880
No. No one ever comes in here.

00:06:54.880 --> 00:06:56.447
Why?

00:06:56.447 --> 00:06:58.188
Moaning Myrtle.

00:06:58.188 --> 00:07:00.277
Who?

00:07:00.277 --> 00:07:02.540
Moaning Myrtle.

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:04.194
Who's Moaning Myrtle?

00:07:04.194 --> 00:07:06.022
I'm Moaning Myrtle.

00:07:11.810 --> 00:07:14.944
I wouldn't expect you
to know me.

00:07:14.944 --> 00:07:17.599
Who would ever talk
about ugly, miserable,

00:07:17.599 --> 00:07:21.516
moping Moaning Myrtle?

00:07:21.516 --> 00:07:23.474
[SCREAMS]

00:07:28.044 --> 00:07:31.003
She's a little sensitive.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:39.882
Gather round! Gather round.

00:07:39.882 --> 00:07:42.275
Can everybody see me?

00:07:42.275 --> 00:07:46.105
Can you all hear me?

00:07:46.105 --> 00:07:47.672
Excellent.

00:07:47.672 --> 00:07:52.372
In the light of the dark events
of recent weeks,

00:07:52.372 --> 00:07:54.505
Professor Dumbledore
has granted me permission

00:07:54.505 --> 00:07:56.681
to start this little
Dueling Club

00:07:56.681 --> 00:07:58.335
to train you all up

00:07:58.335 --> 00:08:01.556
in case you ever need
to defend yourselves,

00:08:01.556 --> 00:08:04.297
as I myself have done
on countless occasions.

00:08:04.297 --> 00:08:07.953
For full details,
see my published works.

00:08:12.088 --> 00:08:15.961
Let me introduce my assistant...

00:08:15.961 --> 00:08:17.441
Professor Snape.

00:08:21.924 --> 00:08:23.795
He has sportingly agreed
to help me

00:08:23.795 --> 00:08:25.362
with a short demonstration.

00:08:25.362 --> 00:08:27.407
Now, I don't want
any of you youngsters to worry.

00:08:27.407 --> 00:08:29.061
You'll still have
your Potions master

00:08:29.061 --> 00:08:30.672
when I'm through with him.

00:08:30.672 --> 00:08:32.108
Never fear.

